    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ANNA: The talks broke down.\nDOROTHY: God help us.",
      "DOROTHY: Chemists are closing early like every other business. Let's make some calls first.\nANNA: I'll find one on the way home.\nDOROTHY: Then we'll go together.\nANNA: Absolutely not!",
      "DOROTHY: Don't.\nANNA: What could I possibly ask?\nDOROTHY: My therapy session are mine alone. Find your own therapist.\nANNA: I just might... You do look like a bit flushed. I wonder what you could have talked about that would have caused that.",
      "ANNA: I suppose you need great faith to believe in either. Good bye.\nDOROTHY: ANNA!\nDOROTHY: Are you certain we should do this?\nANNA: I always looked to someone else for answers. But I've never been more certain."
    ]
  },
